10
00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.820
We're so excited.

11
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.060
We can't wait to share this episode with you.

12
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:34.220
This episode's all about The Office BFFs, our book, because...

13
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:38.040
We are in New York City right now for the launch of our book.

14
00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.560
Oh, my gosh.

15
00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.460
This has been such a long journey.

16
00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:46.620
You guys have been with us every step of the way, truly.

17
00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.840
