You know, we've been doing a bunch of press for the book, and one of the things I did was the Goal Digger podcaSt.

23
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:13.720
Oh, you loved that one.

24
00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:15.060
I loved it with Jenna Kutcher.

25
