32
00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:30.880
And you let it go.

33
00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:32.100
You have to let it go.

34
00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.100
You work on it.

35
00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:34.780
You make it the best it can be.

36
00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:36.800
And then you release it.

37
00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.420
And you have to release it.

38
00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:40.000
You have to let it out.

39
00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:40.660
Let it go.

40
00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.400
Oh, I love that.

41
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:42.760
Right?

42
00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:44.300
I did.

43
00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:44.860
Me too.

44
00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:45.480
I love that.

45
00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:51.220
Well, you know, even though this is a special episode of Office Ladies, we still have to have fast facts.

46
00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:52.500
