51
00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:00.420
Let's do fast facts.

52
00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:01.200
I have one.

53
00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:05.040
Our book was printed in Willard, Ohio.

54
00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:06.200
Hey.

55
00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:12.360
And I thought, well, gee, if our book was printed in Willard, Ohio, I want to know a little bit about Willard, Ohio.

56
00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:13.160
What you got?

57
00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:14.440
Here's what I got.

58
00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:19.320
I went to their official city website, www.willardohio.us.

59
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.480
Here are things I wanted to share.

60
00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:33.820
The town was founded in 1874, but it was named Chicago because it was the train junction for the Baltimore and Ohio railroads line to Sandusky and the branch west to Chicago.

61
00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:35.340
But guess what?

62
00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:35.860
What?

63
00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:37.380
People would get confused.

64
00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:38.740
I would get confused.

65
00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:42.480
I would be on the train and I would be like, did I make it to Chicago?

66
00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:43.300
Illinois?

67
00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:47.420
And they would say, yes, but I wasn't in Chicago, Chicago.

68
00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:49.440
You were in Chicago, Ohio.

69
00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:56.640
I think I would still be confused as a traveler.

70
00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.120
I have to be honest with you.

71
00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:09.620
In 1917, to finally rectify the confusion, the town changed its name to Willard after the then president of the Baltimore and Ohio Railroad Company, Daniel Willard.

72
00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:13.800
And then Willard became an official city in 1960.

73
00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:20.600
Population as of 2019, 60, and here are a few things from their website.

74
00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:23.860
Their slogan is, proud to call Willard home.

75
00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:26.120
Listen to how they describe their city.

76
00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:34.020
A community where people enjoy living and working, ideally situated with easy access to Ohio's interstates and rail lines.

77
00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:37.420
Willard is in the heart of the Midwest manufacturing region.

78
00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:45.260
Abundant land and utilities, a solid work ethic, and a progressive local government make Willard the perfect choice for growing a business.

79
00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:46.520
We have to go.

80
00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:47.520
We have to go.

81
00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:51.320
Not only that, here are a few things that are happening just this month in Willard.

82
00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.560
They honor their hometown heroes.

83
00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:55.740
They started doing this in 2018.

84
00:03:56.220 --> 00:04:04.060
Each week, a different hometown hero will be recognized on the electric sign at the Willard City Park, as well as through the city's Facebook page.

85
00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.060
Very good.

86
00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.180
They have the Willard Tree Program.

87
00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:15.340
In partnership with the Willard Moose Lodge 2153, the city of Willard is offering a tree planting program to help property owners plant trees.

88
00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:18.660
They also have the Downtown Spring Festival.

89
00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:23.040
It's returning this year, featuring the mother of all pickleball tournaments.

90
00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:25.140
I love pickleball!

91
00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:25.800
I know, wait.

92
00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:31.000
Cornhole, craft vendors, touch a truck, bike rodeo, and more.

93
00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.380
Angela, it's becoming very clear to me that we need to go to Willard, Ohio.

94
00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:35.160
I know!

95
00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:37.320
And that's where our book was printed.

96
00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.020
Thank you, Willard, Ohio!

97
00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:40.300
Thank you, Willard, Ohio!

98
00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.060
I also have a few book stats.

99
00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:43.620
Oh!

100
