116
00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:35.460
That we took, by the way, all the photos in the book are personal photos or photos that

117
00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.720
were shared with us from our friends on the show.

118
00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:38.260
Yes.

119
00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:40.720
Here's another stat I love.

120
00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:44.820
There are 41 pieces of memorabilia in the book.

121
00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:51.280
That includes ticket stubs, fan art, posters, brochures, photos of papers and objects and

122
00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:51.680
sketches.

