00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:08.980
As the nurse.

128
00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.660
As the lactation nurse.

129
00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.880
And we scanned it and put it in the book.

130
00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:13.640
